===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|salz}} (akin to {{cog|osx|salt}}, Old Dutch ''salt'', Old English {{m|ang|sealt}}, Old Norse {{m|non|salt}}), from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*saltą}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*seh₂l-|*séh₂l-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*séh₂ls}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|zout}}, English {{m|en|salt}}, Danish {{m|da|salt}}.

